{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Throwables</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the start of each match, every player is randomly assigned a single throwable. These throwables vary from a fiery molotov cocktail to Thor's hammer or a simple stone.\u00a0But the true chaos doesn't end there\u2014throughout the course of the match, five additional random throwables will spawn, scattered across the arena, each one offering fresh opportunities to turn the tide of battle in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Abilities</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a total of 8 unique ability cards, players are equipped with a variety of strategic options that allow them to quickly escape sticky situations or cleverly put their opponents in a difficult spot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Maps</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in epic battles across nine uniquely designed battlefields. Venture into the frozen expanse of the icy tundra; clash in the eerie silence of a dusty, abandoned library; or face the heat and danger of a molten volcano. Each battlefield immerses you in a new world, forcing you to adapt your strategy and conquer diverse environments to claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Special</u></strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The five chaotic cards are game-changers in every sense, introducing twists and turns that no one sees coming.\u00a0Whether you\u2019re on the winning side or mounting a comeback, these cards ensure that no match is ever truly decided until the very end.\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"What the Chuck?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3445670/fbff533c41914c58fab89bb885a38bae704e17af.jpg"},{"name":"Triple Crown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps